    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892840/extras/82b3c4b97675b179ee78ba2143e083fd.avif?t=1753696832\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game background:</h2>After closing the book, I fell into a deep sleep... Zzzzz... But when I opened my eyes again, I saw that I was lying on a huge lawn.<br>&quot;Hey hey...he's awake!&quot;<br>After some confusion and doubts, I realized that I had traveled to a completely different world with girls with very different personalities? They all fell in love with me at first sight. Who should I fall in love with when I am reborn in another world? !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character introduction:</h2><strong>Lalaire</strong>\u2014\u2014<i>Help the goddess solve her problems</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892840/extras/59f688db2d8f7a19d04904f1d20e4b8b.avif?t=1753696832\" width=150 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>Luna</strong>\u2014\u2014<i>The mysterious girl picked up</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892840/extras/ce9bb5cf9ad73372c55650d180691d09.avif?t=1753696832\" width=150 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>Kaylo</strong>\u2014\u2014<i>My mouthless sister</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892840/extras/93b370adbd4e37196412a049d36087eb.avif?t=1753696832\" width=150 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique and innovative single plot story<br></li><li> Casual, fun and classic match-3 mini-game<br></li><li> Cute, beautiful and unique female characters<br></li><li>Skip with one click</li></ul>",
